      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِصْبَاحٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُبْحٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  It is said to
signify also <i>Darkness; contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُبْحٌ</span>, which is
its primary signification: and accord. to EshShereeshee, <i>redness of the hair.</i> (Har p. 284.)

